The Unofficial Implementation of Alpha NIST

This is an independent implementation and is not an official AlphaNIST release.

Method: Octi Zhang et al., AlphaNIST: Emergent Assembly Skills from Binary Task
Rewards, arXiv:2610.13354 (2026), https://arxiv.org/abs/2610.13354.

The policy/PPO implementation references configuration and implementation
behavior in UW-Lab/UWLab, UW-Lab/rsl_rl, and SonyResearch/simba at the revisions
listed in docs/provenance.md. It is not a vendored copy of those repositories.
Their complete license notices are retained in third_party/ for traceability.

Runtime overlays transform installed MuJoCo-Warp source at runtime and retain
its source headers. Runtime packages must be acquired under their own licenses.

Task images incorporate FreeCAD-library source geometry (CC BY 3.0) and,
for the gear render only, NVIDIA IndustRealKit source geometry (NVIDIA
research/evaluation license). Image-specific authors, sources, and changes
are listed in docs/provenance.md and docs/images/provenance.json.

No AlphaNIST authorship, affiliation, endorsement, result, or original-code
ownership is claimed by this repository.
